{"name": "act_ledger_audit", "directory": "harnesses/act_ledger_audit", "hypothesis": "Generating the candidate set from the question's own acts (a ledger of one entry per separate act or component the facts establish, each carrying the unit it calls for) instead of choosing among the reference units, and auditing the draft against that ledger rather than against the reference vocabulary - reporting every entry with no unit in the draft, quoting the closest reference case that answers with more parts when an entry is open, refusing to report the same unit relation twice so the check cannot oscillate between two related units, and inverting the rule to 'alternatives for one slot' when every reference answer is a single part - raises the mean validation score above the 0.584 of iteration 3, mainly by converting strict-subset answers on the multi-unit task into complete ones, without regressing the single-part and free-form tasks.", "candidate_id": "e374821bb1b62c59af5fed0bc63edd2f020a3512678f57d583e33835f432bca3", "split": "val", "spec": {"limit": null, "samples": 2}, "scores": {"USPTO": {"accuracy": 0.21666666666666667, "correct": 13, "total": 60, "num_examples": 30, "aggregation": "sample_mean", "avg_f1": null, "micro_f1": null, "failed_samples": 0, "model_calls": 190, "input_tokens": 2262991, "output_tokens": 531609, "status": "ok", "successful_accuracy": 0.21666666666666667, "successful_samples": 60, "expected_samples": 60, "completion_rate": 1.0, "missing_samples": 0, "errors": [], "error_counts": {}, "partial": false, "rankable": true, "memory_context_chars": 1165.4166666666667, "attempt": 2, "reused_samples": 0}, "Symptom2Disease": {"accuracy": 0.89, "correct": 89, "total": 99, "num_examples": 50, "aggregation": "sample_mean", "avg_f1": null, "micro_f1": null, "failed_samples": 1, "model_calls": 285, "input_tokens": 1971949, "output_tokens": 258118, "status": "partial", "successful_accuracy": 0.898989898989899, "successful_samples": 99, "expected_samples": 100,